DESCRIPTION >
    Leads: true distinct-converter count for a range (used to correct the
    page-length undercount in the leads list). Tenant-scoped; prunes via
    (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1 port of api/routes/leads-server.js:186-192
    (queryName 'leads_count'). Identity rule #19a: count(DISTINCT distinct_id)
    — canonical stitching key, no argMin/argMax. Typed-column translation
    (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6): properties.site_id -> site_id, event -> event_type.
    No JSON-bag fields.
    The live query's date filter is OPTIONAL (only added when the caller
    supplies both date_from and date_to) — ported as an optional Tinybird
    `{% if defined(...) %}` block (date_from_ts/date_to_ts, full boundary
    strings) rather than always-required, to match the source's actual
    conditional behavior instead of forcing a fixed window that isn't there.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.
    DEPLOY FIX (tb --cloud deploy --check, ST_Staging v4.6.4): date/datetime
    params were declared String(param, required=True) then wrapped in
    toDateTime(...) — that combination failed with CANNOT_PARSE_DATETIME
    under --check's '__no_value__' placeholder injection (a non-date string
    toDateTime() can't parse). Fixed by declaring the param itself as
    DateTime(...) (matching the already-shipped Phase 4 pipes' proven
    pattern) and dropping the now-redundant toDateTime(...) wrapper — no
    SQL/filter logic changed, only the param type. Re-validated via
    tb --cloud sql with real values post-fix; parity held (see batch
    dispatch report).

NODE leads_count_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT count(DISTINCT distinct_id) AS leads_count
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
      AND event_type = '$conversion'
      AND lower(coalesce(conversion_type, '')) != 'refund'   -- (A) a refund is not an additional converter (no revenue in this query → WHERE is safe)
      {% if defined(date_from_ts) %}
      AND timestamp >= {{ DateTime(date_from_ts, '1970-01-01 00:00:00') }}
      AND timestamp < {{ DateTime(date_to_ts, '1970-01-01 00:00:00') }}
      {% end %}

TYPE endpoint
